</tr>
<tr nodeId="f3a39df741a34510aa5e4525db4b8c3a">
<td colwidth="[396]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="1cd42b8acd454ba6b71e6a06b9f4f00c">
<h4 nodeId="e93c483270414180991f08585555b0ee"><span font-size="14">Squirrel配置</span></h4>
<ol nodeId="3f13c6dad0254bebab9baf56ae18f47c">
<li nodeId="f63abf0d28404d6ab008cafd7c22bb70"><span font-size="14">存储集群：近线默认存储集群为redis-rc-nearline-public_product，若用户存储在自己的集群上，此处请填写数据所存储的集群英文名称</span></li>
<li nodeId="25947a6d43a049c295cbba483be05b85"><span font-size="14">存储类：为用户在Squirrel上创建的存储名称</span></li>
<li nodeId="96e58f6b4bce4fd097fb8dfe166abaea"><span font-size="14">缓存配置：时间加减，默认30分钟，最长X H；</span></li>
<li nodeId="caf702f5e9c449a8941b4e6109ada63b"><span font-size="14">结果类型：</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">int/string/map/array</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="1c72cf23ec2f468faf46667651426165"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">查询类型：hash/string</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="48a9752ccf0e4a3bbdc51aea33007d2e">
<p nodeId="2ac843deb0e1436699eae6dfe77db9c2"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">查询方式：</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="3bb3ee822ac445d683fde6c83be97ab7"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">当选择hash时，可支持</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下单 field 的 value 值</strong></span><span font-size="14">/</span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下所有 field 值</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">/</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下所有 value 值</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">/</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取所有的 k-v 键值对</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">；</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="3d3ad85856224387a8b0fc86ddd7febd"><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">当选择string时，</span></span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">仅支持</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下单 field 的 value 值</strong></span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="22a452acacd24fa1a92c6459a0e24d8b"><span color="rgb(250, 84, 29)"><span font-size="14">key、value、field均可填写表达式，此处若填写常量需要增加引号比如：'a'</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="83fa916dda6d4ed18eb266bd37e4ce25">
<p nodeId="84e8dc112acd4d319433b4fbe66556bc"><span font-size="14">高级配置（默认收起）：</span></p>
<ol nodeId="8161733faac848da8ad34293c3bb129e">
<li nodeId="9d2a9bb3e9c246d18e7485864227fc91"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">大象通知人：直接输入misid，多个请用逗号隔开，用于熔断、缓存失败进行通知；</span></span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="5d88b89f73b54082986d34af8f03f746">
<p nodeId="115415f0b0c94747ac5148d80a593ee5"><span font-size="14">调用测试：</span></p>
<p nodeId="dad56593d8104ac29bf4a7bcba292261"><span font-size="14">点击保存后，点击“去测试”，进行测试</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="2998c35f417f4e968a4a5826e1f0ada1"><span font-size="14">平台限流值: 6w/min</span><span color="rgb(250, 84, 29)"><span font-size="14">，如需更高流量，请联系近离值班rd</span></span></li>
</ol>
</td>
