<li nodeId="4e36b46d8eb04d8d922349780d8cdd32"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">查询方式：</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下单 field 的 value 值</strong></span><span font-size="14">/</span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下所有 field 值</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">/</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下所有 value 值</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">/</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取所有的 k-v 键值对</strong></span></li>
<li nodeId="3d6bd6bfd58e44c2872b848ecb7b9411"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">key</span></span><span color="rgb(250, 84, 29)"><span font-size="14">可填写表达式，此处若填写常量需要增加引号比如：'a'</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="5b3da8443f87442e82e3fbd21e282a51">
