<li nodeId="b7595a477a2f4ff1a9c0af197cb2c32f"><span font-size="14">存储集群：近线默认存储集群为rcom.sankuai.cellar.mtsi.zeusoffline，若用户存储在自己的集群上，此处请填写数据所存储的集群英文名称，即tair侧的RemoteAppkey值</span></li>
<li nodeId="e6bdace8bd084db9ac3703fffa35f9a1"><span font-size="14">area：近线默认为5，若用户存储在自己的集群上且设置了自己的area，此处请填写数据所存储area；</span></li>
<li nodeId="ff4d333de63844429109c7c0ddc25fae"><span font-size="14">缓存配置：时间加减，默认30分钟，最长X H；</span></li>
<li nodeId="f794ca9527ae4785a47da3701b0a2c92"><span font-size="14">结果类型：</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">int/string/map/array</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="cdf30b77e78e4ee0a9b9dae0e7a0aaa4"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">查询类型：hash/string</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="65a726b91af74f07885fd7877d53c1d2">
<p nodeId="a3e693734a864141bd25a62809bbefbc"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">查询方式：</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="d6189b2ff30a4d029a8271455a262aa1"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">当选择hash时，可支持</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下单 field 的 value 值</strong></span><span font-size="14">/</span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下所有 field 值</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">/</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下所有 value 值</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">/</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取所有的 k-v 键值对</strong></span><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">；</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="eaf4a96a709249b28601eac00de57cd6"><span color="rgb(44, 62, 80)"><span font-size="14">当选择string时，</span></span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">仅支持</span></span><span font-size="14"><strong>获取 key 下单 field 的 value 值</strong></span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="d809d7d178524755bb7d51ee6da06ec0"><span color="rgb(250, 84, 29)"><span font-size="14">key、value、field均可填写表达式，此处若填写常量需要增加引号比如：'a'</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="7b76b82068d441deb72b40e69ff3cd10">
<p nodeId="8d49d07b83e1495ab25b02fb40928482"><span font-size="14">调用测试：</span></p>
<p nodeId="f02d3cbc029d4273868ad6022a6397ac"><span font-size="14">点击保存后，点击“去测试”，进行测试</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="bf1d4ad97f8143bebb5c39ce31d0b2d3"><span font-size="14">平台限流值: 6w/min</span><span color="rgb(250, 84, 29)"><span font-size="14">，如需更高流量，请联系近离值班rd</span></span></li>
</ol>
